        "label": "F · Kleene logic + Filter on missing data",
        "body": "This cluster reuses the null-bearing `vals` from A. **`> 2`** per element → `FALSE, null, TRUE, TRUE`: a comparison with a missing value is **unknown**, not FALSE (Kleene logic). **Filter `> 1`** keeps only TRUE rows, like SQL WHERE, so it drops the unknown row → `3, 4`.",
